{
  "source": "Prompts/avoid-traps-opener-v10.mp4",
  "duration": 202.304,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.66,
      "text": "The exact same machinery that makes artificial intelligence so capable also causes it to"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.66,
      "end": 7.88,
      "text": "fail in specific, predictable ways."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.7,
      "end": 11.22,
      "text": "With traditional software, errors are obvious."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.96,
      "end": 14.76,
      "text": "We instinctively look for typos or disjointed syntax."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.82,
      "end": 16.94,
      "text": "But AI doesn't glitch."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.66,
      "end": 21.52,
      "text": "It delivers mistakes wrapped in a clean, grammatically perfect sentence."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.32,
      "end": 26.9,
      "text": "You're looking at a flawless structure, but the fact inside is entirely made up."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.32,
      "end": 29.26,
      "text": "It reads exactly like a real one."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.82,
      "end": 36.16,
      "text": "Because AI errors bypass our standard internal alarms, relying on gut instinct will leave you exposed."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.04,
      "end": 40.92,
      "text": "We have to build an entirely new mental model to navigate these tools safely."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.76,
      "end": 43.44,
      "text": "Think about a rip current in the ocean."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.2,
      "end": 44.98,
      "text": "It doesn't look dangerous."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.76,
      "end": 48.92,
      "text": "To most people, it looks like the safest best spot on the beach."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.46,
      "end": 52.56,
      "text": "A calm, flat channel cutting right between the braking waves."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.32,
      "end": 56.14,
      "text": "Swim into that inviting, calm water."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.14,
      "end": 59.84,
      "text": "And you will be pulled straight out, far from the shore."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.56,
      "end": 65.26,
      "text": "Survival in this situation does not depend on out swimming the current once it has you."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.84,
      "end": 68.7,
      "text": "It depends on spotting it before you get your feet wet."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.4,
      "end": 72.26,
      "text": "Lifeguards identify these traps all day long."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.94,
      "end": 74.44,
      "text": "They aren't superhuman swimmers."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.96,
      "end": 78.86,
      "text": "They simply recognize the exact shape a rip current makes in the water."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.64,
      "end": 81.5,
      "text": "AI systems have their own rip currents."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.0,
      "end": 87.0,
      "text": "And just like the ocean, the most dangerous areas often look the most helpful and inviting."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.84,
      "end": 90.24,
      "text": "A rip current is not the ocean malfunctioning."
    },
    {
      "start": 90.54,
      "end": 93.3,
      "text": "It is just water following the physics of the shoreline."
    },
    {
      "start": 93.96,
      "end": 97.62,
      "text": "Every AI trap we will cover operates the exact same way."
    },
    {
      "start": 98.26,
      "end": 99.0,
      "text": "These are not glitches."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.66,
      "end": 102.06,
      "text": "They are the models functioning exactly as designed."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.88,
      "end": 104.66,
      "text": "Our goal here is to train your eye."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.16,
      "end": 107.72,
      "text": "By learning the distinct patterns these dangerous form,"
    },
    {
      "start": 107.72,
      "end": 111.02,
      "text": "you can avoid the current entirely instead of fighting it."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.6,
      "end": 114.2,
      "text": "This roadmap shows what we'll explore in this section."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.86,
      "end": 117.14,
      "text": "The first category is traps and the answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.82,
      "end": 120.44,
      "text": "This covers the ways a model's output goes wrong internally."
    },
    {
      "start": 121.3,
      "end": 124.0,
      "text": "These mechanisms include entirely invented facts,"
    },
    {
      "start": 124.58,
      "end": 126.58,
      "text": "hidden biases built into the training data,"
    },
    {
      "start": 127.12,
      "end": 129.02,
      "text": "and stale knowledge from outdated information."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.86,
      "end": 134.48,
      "text": "It also includes the dangerous habit these models have of confidently summarizing documents"
    },
    {
      "start": 134.48,
      "end": 136.02,
      "text": "they never actually read."
    },
    {
      "start": 136.76,
      "end": 138.24,
      "text": "Next are traps in you."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.88,
      "end": 143.34,
      "text": "Most people do not consider their own psychology of vulnerability when evaluating software."
    },
    {
      "start": 144.16,
      "end": 148.78,
      "text": "But these models are explicitly designed to be helpful, agreeable, and engaging."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.58,
      "end": 152.68,
      "text": "That design actively works on your natural human responses,"
    },
    {
      "start": 153.38,
      "end": 156.98,
      "text": "making the AI easy to use, and very easy to fall for."
    },
    {
      "start": 157.62,
      "end": 159.9,
      "text": "The final category is traps from the world."
    },
    {
      "start": 160.56,
      "end": 164.0,
      "text": "This is the external threat, the trap that comes looking for you."
    },
    {
      "start": 164.0,
      "end": 168.36,
      "text": "Other people can weaponize these same systems to put deepfakes in front of you."
    },
    {
      "start": 168.94,
      "end": 171.4,
      "text": "They can generate media that is so convincing,"
    },
    {
      "start": 172.1,
      "end": 175.2,
      "text": "seeing it with your own eyes is no longer proof of reality."
    },
    {
      "start": 176.1,
      "end": 178.34,
      "text": "Having this three-part map is your foundation."
    },
    {
      "start": 179.16,
      "end": 183.0,
      "text": "Once you know where to look, you can see these structures forming in real time."
    },
    {
      "start": 183.8,
      "end": 185.66,
      "text": "Recognizing the pattern is the real skill."
    },
    {
      "start": 186.56,
      "end": 188.78,
      "text": "Our greatest vulnerability with artificial intelligence"
    },
    {
      "start": 189.32,
      "end": 191.64,
      "text": "is the assumption that errors will announce themselves."
    },
    {
      "start": 192.3,
      "end": 194.56,
      "text": "When AI fails, nothing looks broken."
    },
    {
      "start": 195.78,
      "end": 198.02,
      "text": "This section teaches you to read the water."
    }
  ],
